&lt;p&gt;Join our Flight Engineering team advancing the&amp;nbsp;Air Dominance and Strike division&#39;s portfolio, where we push the boundaries of aerospace technology.&amp;nbsp;As a critical member of our team, the role of a Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (GNC) Engineer is pivotal in driving the design, development, testing, and implementation of cutting-edge flight system technologies for our aerospace systems. Anduril fosters a dynamic learning culture, characterized by accelerated knowledge acquisition through modeling, simulation, analysis, and rigorous and frequent ground and flight test experimentation. At Anduril, you will be involved in flight testing the systems you develop.&lt;/p&gt;
