&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril’s Flight Engineering department is seeking Guidance, Navigation and Control (GNC) Engineers to join our team. The Anduril Flight Engineering team is integral to development of flight system solutions in all domains for our warfighters. As a critical member of our team, the role of a Guidance, Navigation, and Control (GNC) Engineer is pivotal in driving the design, development, testing, and implementation of cutting-edge flight system technologies for our aerospace systems. Anduril fosters a dynamic learning culture, characterized by accelerated knowledge acquisition through modeling, simulation, analysis, and rigorous and frequent ground and flight test experimentation. At Anduril, you will be involved in flight testing the systems you develop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking exceptional GNC Engineers&amp;nbsp;with expertise in Navigation, Sensing, or PNT to join our team. The successful candidate will play a pivotal role in&amp;nbsp;shaping the next generation of autonomous air power, advanced tactical missile systems, strategic weapons, and hypersonic strike and defense systems. As a key contributor, you will develop, test, and integrate navigation systems and architectures for subsonic, supersonic, and hypersonic autonomous systems, driving innovation in mission-critical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-WHATYOU’LLDO&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;efd9701c-743a-484c-b8fc-617718b61a11&quot;&gt;Lead navigation system design for one or more Anduril products, cradle-to-grave ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;26fb8364-567a-49b9-a2cc-72a0ddb20515&quot;&gt;Analyze and help develop mission requirements and constraints across the Anduril product portfolio to determine optimal navigation system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a105eda2-b0e8-48e4-bccd-b878df726f4e&quot;&gt;Support and drive the evaluation and integration of advanced alternative navigation aiding sources (prepare, support, and conduct lab, motion, and flight tests).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0fe06169-7ac6-4bf8-90a7-3e860cc0cf2e&quot;&gt;Support flight testing to measure &amp;amp; validate navigation performance relative to mission requirements and troubleshoot testing and operational anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c1781a7b-1d18-411e-8914-47044523d1f2&quot;&gt;Perform trade studies, modeling, simulation and other forms of analysis to validate algorithm and navigation stack accuracy, robustness, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6c3ab158-6748-4418-89b2-36738e9cb8c0&quot;&gt;Conduct simulation and testing for validation of navigation algorithms and system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2c27d11c-1c53-46e0-a291-4a3b2e1fc681&quot;&gt;Collect and analyze platform telemetry data to validate platform operation and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;547d5a5e-1252-48b8-acf1-cae8bdcf1c90&quot;&gt;Support the design, development, integration and testing of an inertial navigation systems (INS) for aerospace vehicles (UAS, spacecraft, missiles, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d90ae50b-3f0e-45f9-9492-8511121298fa&quot;&gt;Use and update Anduril&#39;s existing navigation filters, models, and simulations to improve navigation performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1ce513cb-7f53-4d50-935d-92b95f20e31d&quot;&gt;Support and drive the development of algorithms for navigation, guidance, and control systems, including Extended Kalman filters and other estimation methods using various programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3f4a82b2-36e2-412d-b05c-f98bc4e4dd4d&quot;&gt;Support and drive the development of advanced sensor fusion algorithms leveraging INS, GNSS, cameras, LiDAR, and other sensors for accurate navigation in complex environments across subsea, surface, air, and space domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c669d703-98d3-4a42-b8b5-d05c6d201e25&quot;&gt;Apply covariance analysis techniques for early requirements derivation, as well as to optimize navigation system performance, error modeling, and system uncertainty assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;f687aa3f-39ab-4d82-9112-55c5e917afe3&quot;&gt;Improve calibration procedures for sensor suites used in aerospace navigation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;15026317-7d6b-41c1-91f6-0d152a054d7c&quot;&gt;Collaborate with&amp;nbsp;GNC, Flight Software, MSA, T&amp;amp;E, product leadership, and other&amp;nbsp;multidisciplinary teams to integrate navigation software and hardware into real-world flight systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-REQUIREDQUALIFICATIONS:&quot;&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3e514669-a12d-4158-a0aa-8c4cbd4b9cd9&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Aerospace Engineering, Electrical Engineering,&amp;nbsp;Computer Science&amp;nbsp;or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;59670475-3310-4bea-bfe4-64c7956254fd&quot;&gt;Strong bias for action, ability to thrive in uncertainty, and desire to closely collaborate cross-functionally with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;7ec95d98-0aaa-4b25-b5e9-f456ac515c49&quot;&gt;Proficiency in MATLAB &amp;amp; Simulink, C/C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;88c1b57a-08d1-4a5f-b9a3-75eaed9353c7&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of navigation principles, including inertial navigation, GPS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b21a66d6-15dc-4a32-94e2-6d34822b04ab&quot;&gt;Experience characterizing, integrating, and testing inertial and non-inertial sensing modalities like INS, GNSS, vision-based, and odometry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;679301ee-030d-49b2-bd71-a728cfe8d9fc&quot;&gt;Experience with navigation system design, development and testing on aerospace systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;250454a9-f3da-49e4-8753-09d80e2695e2&quot;&gt;Expertise in Kalman filtering, Extended Kalman filtering, and other estimation techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;49ebb596-ea8e-4cc9-97c0-bd977e99e57c&quot;&gt;Experience with real-time systems and embedded software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;51a66604-af15-4144-b0a0-10156e8ce272&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;fc9a7e18-fad1-4c45-8cdd-7f327f9e9ad2&quot;&gt;General knowledge of guidance and flight control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ef7d624f-a8d0-4835-8a4a-1250e530d227&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;optimizing and tuning navigation system performance, error modeling, and system uncertainty assessments, and requirements methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;819a6129-0349-4874-8290-6a3068d65477&quot;&gt;Must be eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Top Secret clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-Guidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)Engineer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (GNC) Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;adf389bb-c742-4f00-86aa-282cfacbd753&quot;&gt;3 or more years of experience in Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control engineering&amp;nbsp;or related technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)Engineer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (GNC) Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;888aeb50-469d-4f28-b3e9-0c9437564dd8&quot;&gt;8 or more years of experience in Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control engineering or related technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-PREFERREDQUALIFICATIONS:&quot;&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a7db57ed-7059-4bae-bf62-5271435edf8a&quot;&gt;Autonomous air, ground or undersea vehicle navigation experience, focusing on low-cost sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;63fb98e2-2ac2-4f41-be87-283c82734f43&quot;&gt;Strong software (MATLAB, C/C++) and hardware (sensors, harnesses, PCB design) integration background, working with real-time systems is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;big&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0f961950-1bed-4688-9b60-fcfb1252aac8&quot;&gt;Experience adapting and applying real-time pose localization algorithms from robotics to enhance the accuracy and robustness of vehicle navigation where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d2ef654b-5e5b-44fc-b41e-51cb86b1b69a&quot;&gt;Experience with 6-DOF vehicle simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b48f840e-c3c1-478e-ad61-2f2e878a0a1f&quot;&gt;GNSS receiver and antenna integration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;cec092b4-da43-461d-8565-6eb051b4aea2&quot;&gt;Current eligibility at the Top Secret level preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per Anduril&#39;s expansion plans, we anticipate this job will be based out of Long Beach, CA beginning late 2027.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$129,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The CW Systems Technical Operations Engineering team is seeking a Technical Operations Engineer with a specialization in HVAC systems. This role requires comprehensive knowledge of environmental regulations, including those enforced by OSHA and refrigerant management standards from the EPA. As a Technical Operations Engineer, you will not only deploy our products to customers, but also play a pivotal role in the customer handoff and ongoing sustainment of our systems.&amp;nbsp; As a key contributor to the Technical Operations Engineering team, your role is to seamlessly integrate the product engineering and deployment operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for the complete ownership of all dependencies, ensuring the seamless operation of Anduril’s suite of integrated hardware-software solutions in diverse environments.&amp;nbsp; In your role, you will collaborate closely with the product development team, utilizing your extensive operations and engineering background to deliver highly effective and reliable solutions. Your responsibilities will span a variety of areas, such as:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;HVAC System Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Repair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;System Reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deployment at Scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Incident Triage and Root-Cause Analysis in HVAC Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;User Experience and Software Tool Enhancements for HVAC Control Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pre-deployment Testing and Configuration of HVAC Units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Furthermore, as a Technical Operations Engineer, you are integral to customer demonstrations, events, and the initial deployment of Anduril’s CW products. The insights you gather from these experiences will feed back into product development and enable you to guide others in the deployment and operation of our products.&amp;nbsp; You will play a central role in the end-to-end customer success, ensuring that our offerings are well-understood and effectively supported from initial handoff through sustained operation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Based in Costa Mesa, California; adept at collaborating with a distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Profound hands-on expertise with HVAC systems, including maintenance, repair, and operational methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Expertise in HVAC troubleshooting and diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of HVAC system design and specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams and external customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competency in data-driven analysis and HVAC system troubleshooting, with a strong grasp of OSHA and EPA standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Skill in educating others on HVAC equipment operation with a focus on safety and environmental protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50%, potentially to remote or austere locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in resolving complex HVAC challenges effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Recognition as a technical authority on HVAC system installation, maintenance, and sustainment in challenging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Self-sufficiency in HVAC maintenance and hardware replacement; availability for prompt travel to customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain an active U.S. Top Secret security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Able to meet health and medical requirements in advance of deployments in accordance with DFARS 252.225-7040, DoDI 3020.41, and/or any additional requirements outlined by region or supporting force, as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
