&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and deploy a real-time, map-based interface for displaying and interacting with sensor data and commanding physical assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fetch and manage large streams of data while maintaining performant rendering in a low-friction user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and design immersive image-viewing experiences in a web-based platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of initial, well-scoped projects with clear objectives. Work closely with colleagues to deliver results, understanding the importance of teamwork in achieving success.&lt;/li&gt;
