&lt;li&gt;Functional Safety certification (TUV Rheinland, TUV SUD, or CMSE [TUV NORD]), or willingness to obtain one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with control panel layout, electrical component selection, and cable routing&lt;/li&gt;
