&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Assess and allocate necessary resources, including personnel, software, and hardware, to ensure the project is adequately supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Monitor resource utilization and make adjustments as needed to avoid bottlenecks or resource constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
