&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Use flight data to monitor the health of our Falcon vehicle fleet, including engine performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Execute dynamic testing from start-to-finish (pre-test planning, sensor selection &amp;amp; installation, testing, data and signal processing, and model correlation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
