&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with layout design, both warehouse and manufacturing lineside layouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an industrial, operations, process or manufacturing engineer in a developmental manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Supply Chain planning design and warehousing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience solving challenging quantitative problems in fast paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lean, six sigma, and related production principles&lt;/li&gt;
