&lt;li&gt;Develop highly reliable software solutions that are used across SpaceX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create new applications that improve how SpaceX operates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prototypes to prove out key design concepts and quantify technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
