&lt;li&gt;Have experience in trust and safety, content operations, policy enforcement, or a related operational role at a technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments — you&#39;re energized rather than frustrated when the path forward isn&#39;t clearly defined and you need to figure it out as you go&lt;/li&gt;
