&lt;li&gt;C++, Python, JavaScript (React &amp;amp; Angular), Microsoft Excel, Spark, PySpark, SQL (T-SQL Postgres), Enterprise Data Systems like Palantir Foundry a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
