&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is looking for a multidisciplinary Industrial Security Officer (PERSEC) to serve as a Personnel Security Analyst within our Hawthorne, CA office. This is a chance to fill a critical role within a dynamic and high-tempo environment working on programs pushing the boundaries of industry and technology. A successful candidate will be a self-starter and problem-solver and will possess the ability to convey security requirements to a diverse group of technical personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all Personnel Security (PERSEC) aspects of a variety of missions at the SCI, SAP and Collateral level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all steps of PERSEC processing in an efficient manner, including pre-screening, clearance initiation, review of paperwork and customer submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to develop a deep understanding of the clearance processes for SCI, SAP and Collateral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to develop a deep understanding of security clearance databases including DISS, NBIS, JADE, TALON, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully interact with a variety of government customers to ensure clearances are processed efficiently on the government side&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process improvement opportunities and question assumptions to make procedures as streamlined as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all reporting requirements for the entirety of the cleared SpaceX population, to include foreign travel, life changes, incidents and adverse information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate indoctrinations and debriefings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Mission Management and government representatives to ensure SpaceX is providing the best possible security clearance support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholder teams to reinforce their understanding of clearance holder requirements and ensure those requirements are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare for and assist with the PERSEC component of compliance inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct security related inquires and incident reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep abreast of the latest security trends and policy updates, implementing innovative solutions and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
