&lt;li&gt;Serve as the customer interface at meetings, tests, and reviews to develop integration plans, assist in architectural overviews, and ensure customer success when building out communications and data systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contract deliverables are completed on-time and per customer expectations, distill customer requirements into actionable development objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with all internal and external stakeholders to drive prototype development. Collaborate with subsystem representatives across team boundaries to consider all necessary trades and ensure end-to-end mission success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all phases of the program from pre-sales consultations, integrations, testing, troubleshooting and steady state operations. This will include educating the customer on our designs and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage network centric features for Starshield customers, interface with network and software engineering teams to develop turnkey solutions for customers using existing products, or spur new product development to fill gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in an engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in the aerospace or defense industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of technical project management and/or systems engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with satellite communications networks and IP networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work under pressure and deliver reliable and expeditious results across multiple parallel priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail oriented, hardworking, and professional with excellent written and verbal technical communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in network engineering (LAN/WAN, routing, IP transit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data science proficiency (SQL or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong penchant for innovation in process improvement and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, “can-do” attitude, self-starter, and ability to work in a high pace dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, verbal, and written skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with foreign governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
