&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pass Air Force background checks for Cape Canaveral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to travel - up to 20% work week travel may be required to other sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position may involve long hours and weekend work as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in Cape Canaveral, FL, and requires being on-site&lt;/li&gt;
